{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And you shall place some of your hod upon him.</b> Give him some authority of sovereignty during your lifetime, so that they begin to treat him with honor." "<b>So that they will heed.</b> The reason for the appointment before their eyes and the bestowal of the hod during your lifetime is so that the entire congregation — which is the Sanhedrin and the elders of the people — will heed his voice."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:41:15.519349769Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}